  <data name="Templates.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Task Template Library</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Production-ready presets for common automation jobs. Deploying a template opens the task editor pre-filled with the command, arguments and a recommended schedule.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Info.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Nothing is created until you save</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Info.Message" xml:space="preserve"><value>Review the command, arguments and trigger in the editor before saving - several templates delete files or change system state, and some need administrator privileges.</value></data>
