  <data name="Templates.TempCleanup.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Nightly Temp File Cleanup</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.TempCleanup.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deletes files older than 7 days from the user and Windows temp folders. Files still in use are skipped.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.TempCleanup.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deletes files permanently - review the age threshold before deploying.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.UpdateHealth.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Windows Update Health Check</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.UpdateHealth.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Reports pending Windows updates and the last successful install date to a log file in your Documents folder.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.UpdateHealth.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Requires administrator privileges to query the update agent.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Defrag.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Disk Optimize (Defrag / TRIM)</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Defrag.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Runs the built-in Windows optimizer on the system drive. SSDs receive a TRIM/retrim, HDDs are defragmented.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.Defrag.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Requires administrator privileges. Runs only when the PC is idle and on AC power.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.GitFetch.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Git Repository Fetch / Backup</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.GitFetch.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Fetches all remotes with pruning for every Git repository found under a folder you choose. Edit the path before saving.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.GitFetch.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Change 'C:\Repos' to your own repository root, and make sure git is on PATH.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.DockerPrune.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Docker System Prune</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.DockerPrune.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Removes stopped containers, unused networks, dangling images and build cache to reclaim disk space.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.DockerPrune.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Requires Docker Desktop to be running. Deletes unused Docker data permanently.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.LogRotation.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Daily Log Rotation</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.LogRotation.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Compresses yesterday's *.log files into a dated ZIP archive and removes archives older than 30 days.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.LogRotation.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Change 'C:\Logs' to your own log directory before deploying.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.IdleShutdown.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Auto-Shutdown at Night when Idle</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.IdleShutdown.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Shuts the PC down at night, but only after it has been idle - with a 60 second warning you can cancel.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.IdleShutdown.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Shuts the machine down. Unsaved work in open apps may be lost.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.BatterySaver.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Battery Saver Task Suspend</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.BatterySaver.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Switches Windows to the Power Saver plan at logon so background work is throttled while unplugged.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.BatterySaver.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pair this with the Global Snooze toggle to pause your own tasks while on battery.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.RecycleBin.Name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Empty Recycle Bin Weekly</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.RecycleBin.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Empties the Recycle Bin for the current user once a week without a confirmation prompt.</value></data>
  <data name="Templates.RecycleBin.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deleted items become unrecoverable once the bin is emptied.</value></data>
